#===============================================================================
# Tandem Tales Web Server Environment Variables
#===============================================================================
# These values are typically set by tools like Docker Compose that are using
# this image as part of a larger project. They can also be set manually here.

#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent Settings
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If 'agent_name' below is set, then an agent with these details will be
# automatically added to the Tandem Tales server database immediately after it
# starts. If 'agent_name' is not set, other values are ignored. If the other
# values are not set, they will not be used. For example, if 'agent_password' is
# not set, the agent will not use a password.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# agent_name="myagent"
# agent_password="dummy"
# agent_title="My Agent"
# agent_description="This is an example agent."

#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Play Settings
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For convenience, the homepage displays a link to automatically start playing
# Tandem Tales via the web client without choosing configuration options. If
# these variables are set, their values will be used in that link. The variable
# 'play_partner' can be set to the same value as 'agent_name' if you want to
# play with the same agent that was added to the database at startup.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# play_world="tutorial"
# play_role="PLAYER"
# play_partner="myagent"